    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a1">

                <pb facs="0579" n="467" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg467"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Ecuador to
                        the Ecuadorian Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-06-03"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I was notified yesterday (Thursday) about the date set for the retirement of
                    troops from the frontiers. Immediately I gave orders for their mobilization to
                    the neighboring Provinces.</p>
                <p>Please explain that long distances require time to withdraw the army scattered
                    about the different towns of the frontier, but all will be accomplished in six
                    days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alfaro.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
